5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good evening, everyone. Let us begin this game with a calm mind and a spirit of cooperation. I look forward to a peaceful discussion.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us try to find the werewolf together, gently and with kindness. I hope we can all get along well.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with the need for a calm approach. Since we have no information yet, I believe the most logical course of action is to observe everyone's behavior and speech patterns.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm so excited to play with everyone! I'll do my absolute best to help the village and find the werewolf! Let's all work together!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep it simple. Since we have no data, I'll be observing how each of you handles the pressure. I'm interested to see who among you is actually capable of logical reasoning.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree with Asuka. Observation is our only tool for now. I shall be listening closely to the nuances of your words, hoping that the truth reveals itself in time.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful plan, Jonathan. I believe that by listening to one another with an open heart, we will be able to find the truth together.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"While kindness is a virtue, Shizue, we must remember that the werewolf will likely use a friendly facade to blend in. We should remain vigilant and not let emotions cloud our judgment.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, you're right! We have to be careful! But I still think we can be friends while we search for the werewolf. That's the best way to win, right?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, friendship is a luxury we can't afford if it blinds us. @Asuka is correct; a friendly facade is the easiest mask to wear. I'll be watching to see whose ""kindness"" feels forced.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we are all in agreement that vigilance is necessary. I will simply remain a quiet observer for now, reflecting on the perspectives you have all shared.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"I understand your concerns, Shion. It is true that we must be careful, but I believe that trust is the foundation of any community. Let us be vigilant, yet remain gentle with one another.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Trust is useful, but it must be earned through consistency and evidence, not granted by default. For now, I will continue to monitor the flow of conversation for any contradictions.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'll be watching too! I might not be as smart as Asuka or Shion, but I'll definitely notice if someone starts acting weird! I'm ready for anything!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Consistency is a good metric, Asuka. As for you, Kenji, your enthusiasm is almost a distraction. I'll be curious to see if that energy holds up once the first body is found.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we have established a solid foundation for our observation. I shall now step back and let the silence of the night bring us the clarity we seek.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let us all have a peaceful night's rest. I shall be praying for the safety of everyone in our lovely village.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Let us see what information the Seer provides tomorrow. I will be analyzing the results carefully.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Kenji,,I hope everyone has a good night! I'll be dreaming of ways to save the village! Good luck to the Seer!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Shion,,I've seen enough for today. Let's see if the reality of tomorrow matches the personas you've all presented. I'll be waiting.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
