36,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. Now that the first night has passed, I wonder if the Seer has found a lead to guide us.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning to you all. I slept quite peacefully, thank you. I hope you all feel refreshed as well. I wonder if our kind Seer has found any clues to help us?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"If the Seer has information, now is the time to share it. A prompt revelation could save us from unnecessary losses, provided the claim is logically sound and not a werewolf's attempt to manipulate us.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I have some really important news! I'm the Seer, and I checked Shion last night. It turns out Shion is the werewolf! Everyone, please believe me, we have to stop them right now!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, that was fast. To claim the Seer role and point at me immediately is a very clumsy attempt at a frame. Tell me, do you always lie with such enthusiasm, or is this a special occasion?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"This is quite a sudden development. @Kenji, your confidence is striking, but @Shion's reaction is equally sharp. I find myself wondering if this is a genuine discovery or a calculated move to sow discord.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my, what a surprising start to the morning! @Kenji, you seem so certain, but @Shion is very upset. Please, let us all take a deep breath so we can discuss this calmly.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, claiming the Seer role on the first turn is a high-risk strategy. If you are the Seer, you've given the werewolf a target. If you are the werewolf, you're attempting a fast-track execution. We need to evaluate the probability of both.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, I'm not trying to be risky, I just wanted to tell you guys right away so we don't lose anyone else! I'm really the Seer! Shion is the werewolf, I saw it! Please, we have to trust me!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, you've already identified the risk. Kenji's desperation is palpable. He's not acting like a Seer; he's acting like a werewolf who panicked and decided to strike first. Tell me, Kenji, why are you so afraid of me?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a difficult position to be in. If Kenji is the Seer, we have found our enemy. However, if he is the werewolf, he is attempting to lead us into a grave mistake. I find myself leaning toward caution.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is heartbreaking to see such a disagreement between you two. @Kenji, you have such a spirited heart, and @Shion, you are so composed. I wish there were a way for us to know the truth without any sadness.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, sadness is irrelevant to the facts. @Kenji, your emotional appeal doesn't provide evidence. @Shion, your composure is noted, but it doesn't prove innocence. We must decide if Kenji's claim is too reckless to be true.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, I'm not just being emotional! I'm telling the truth! I know I'm not the smartest, but the Seer's power doesn't lie! Shion is the werewolf, and if we don't vote for them, the werewolf will just keep attacking us!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, you're the only one here thinking clearly. Kenji's ""power"" is nothing more than a loud voice. If he were the Seer, he'd be more concerned about the Possessed than rushing to execute a target. He's simply trying to drown out logic with noise.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"The tension is palpable. While Kenji's urgency is clear, Shion's logic is compelling. I believe we should consider the possibility that Kenji is overreaching. Perhaps it is safer to vote for Kenji today to see if the village survives.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is so sad to see us turning against one another. @Kenji, I want to believe your honest heart, but @Jonathan and @Asuka have a point. I shall follow the wisdom of the group.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
53,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
54,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The probability of a Seer revealing themselves this aggressively on turn one is low. Kenji's lack of a strategic approach suggests he is either the werewolf or the Possessed attempting to eliminate a threat. I will vote for Kenji.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Wait! Please don't do this! I'm really the Seer! @Jonathan, @Asuka, you're making a huge mistake! If you vote for me, the werewolf wins! Shion is lying to you! Please, just trust me one time! I'm not the werewolf!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,1,4,talk,Shion,,"It's almost poetic, isn't it? The louder the scream, the more obvious the lie. You've played your hand, Kenji, and it was a losing one. I'll enjoy watching your desperation fade as the village chooses logic over noise.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
57,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
